    "registered_on": "rest_api_init -> Bptodo_REST_Controller::register_routes (wired includes/class-bptodo.php:244)",
    "nonce": "wp_rest (X-WP-Nonce; exposed to the Interactivity store as state.nonce, includes/render/class-bptodo-renderer.php:137)",
    "note": "Added in 4.0.0. A thin adapter over includes/domain/ (Bptodo_Todo_Repository / Bptodo_Permissions / Bptodo_Categories) - no business logic in the controller. Backs the blocks + Interactivity frontend and any future client. 6 register_rest_route calls -> 12 method endpoints."
  },
